'''Humungousaur'''{{Refn|[[:File:B10R2 (622).png]]|group = credits}}<ref name="B10RP2"/>{{Refn|group = note|Humungousaur was originally intended to be spelled as "Humongousaur" according to the first draft of the '''Hero Generation''' series bible, dated June 3, 2007.{{Refn|[https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/ben10/images/2/23/Hero_Generation_Series_Bible.pdf Hero Generation Series Bible]|group = HG Bible}} According to [[Derrick J. Wyatt]], the officially used name was a typo that stuck and became canon. However, he proposed that the original name was instead "Humungosaur", which is not as yet corroborated in any contemporary sources.{{Refn|group = DJW|[[:File:Humungousaur's Original Spelling.png]]}}}} is the [[Omnitrix]]'s DNA sample of a [[Vaxasaurian (Classic)|Vaxasaurian]]<ref>[[Albedo]]</ref><ref name=":0">''[[The Ultimate Heist]]''</ref> from the planet [[Terradino (Classic)|Terradino]].{{Refn|[[:File:Humungousaur Bandai Card.png]]|group = Bandai}}

==Appearance==
===Ben as Humungousaur===
Humungousaur is a semi-humanoid 12-foot-tall{{Refn|[[:File:Humungousaur Bio AF Game.png]]|group = AF VG}} [[Wikipedia:Dinosaur|dinosaur]]-like alien, with long arms and short legs. He has hard skin that is colored brown on its outer side and cream on its inner side. Both Gwen and Azmuth share these traits as Humungousaur.

In '''[[Ben 10: Alien Force (TV Series)|Alien Force]]''' and '''[[Ben 10: Ultimate Alien (TV Series)|Ultimate Alien]]''', Humungousaur wore the [[Omnitrix (Original)|original Omnitrix]]/[[Ultimatrix (Original)|Ultimatrix]] symbol on his chest.

In '''''[[Ben 10: Alien Swarm|Alien Swarm]]''''', Humungousaur has slit pupils.

In ''[[Video Games (Episode)|Video Games]]'', Humungousaur wore a blue motion capture suit.

In ''[[Ben 10-Generator Rex: Heroes United|Heroes United]]'', the plates on his chest ended in spikes and he had spikes above his eyes.

In '''[[Ben 10: Omniverse (TV Series)|Omniverse]]''', Humungousaur wears black briefs with a white waistband, and a green and a black [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bandolier bandolier] across his chest (going from his right shoulder to the left side of his lower back) containing the [[Omnitrix (Omniverse)|Omnitrix]] symbol. Humungousaur now has grey fingernails instead of brown, a slightly bigger chin, green eyes in the same hue of his Omnitrix symbol, a shorter build, and his nose is positioned on his forehead.

===Albedo as Negative Humungousaur===
In ''[[Good Copy, Bad Copy]]'', [[Albedo|Negative]] Humungousaur looked exactly like [[Ben Tennyson (Classic)|Ben]]'s Humungousaur. In ''[[The Final Battle: Part 1]]'', Negative Humungousaur had red eyes and his Ultimatrix symbol was red as well.

In '''Omniverse''', Negative Humungousaur has a darker skin color, creamy-white inner side and a red [[Ultimatrix (Stabilizer)|Ultimatrix]] sash across his chest in the opposite direction as Ben's Humungousaur. His eyes are the same red as his sash.

===Naljian Destructor as Humungousaur===
The [[Naljian Destructor]] as Humungousaur looked like Ben's Humungousaur in '''Alien Force''' and '''Ultimate Alien''', but with glowing light green eyes and a glowing Omnitrix symbol.

