*In ''[[Of Predators and Prey: Part 2]]'', Humungousaur battled [[Mucilator (Transformation)|Mucilator]], who then transformed into [[Tyrannopede]], whom he failed to defeat.
*In ''[[Outbreak]]'', Humungousaur defeated [[Rook Blonko|Rook]] in a training session.
