*In ''[[And Then There Were None]]'', Negative Humungousaur briefly appeared before going Ultimate.
*In ''[[Stuck on You]]'', Humungousaur defeated [[Khyber]], as Tyrannopede, with the help of [[Skurd]].
*In ''[[A New Dawn]]'', Humungousaur appeared for a short time when [[Ben Tennyson (Classic)|Ben]] was cycling through his aliens.

