==Trivia==
*Humungousaur is the final alien used by [[Ben Tennyson (Classic)|Ben]] with the [[Omnitrix (Original)|original Omnitrix]].
*Humungousaur is the first alien used on-screen in '''[[Ben 10: Ultimate Alien (TV Series)|Ultimate Alien]]''', as well as the first alien to go Ultimate on-screen.<ref name="TFB1" />
* Humungousaur is the first alien used by [[Albedo]] in '''[[Ben 10: Alien Force (TV Series)|Alien Force]]'''.
*As a running gag in '''Omniverse'''<nowiki>'</nowiki>s Arc 1, Ben had many unsuccessful attempts in transforming into Humungousaur until ''[[Of Predators and Prey: Part 2]]''.
* Out of all transformations, Humungousaur is the alien used by most characters other than Ben, having been used by [[Albedo]], [[Azmuth (Classic)|Azmuth]], Vilgax's [[Bioid]]s, [[Plant Clones|Plant Ben]], and [[Gwen Tennyson (Classic)|Gwen]].
**Humungousaur is also the most used transformation in the entire Classic Continuity, appearing a total of 89 times.
* During the pre-production stage of '''Alien Force''', Humungousaur had concept art drawn by [[Eric Canete]].{{Refn|[[:File:Eric Canete Designed Humungousaur Concepts.png]]|group = EC}}
**Humungousaur's '''Omniverse''' design was made by [[Derrick J. Wyatt]].{{Refn|[[:File:Some of the Aliens Designed by Derrick in OV.png]]|group = DJW}}
*During '''Alien Force''' and '''Ultimate Alien''', [[Dwayne McDuffie]] and [[Glen Murakami]] sometimes gave suggestions to the writers on which aliens Ben should use in each episode, to prevent Humungousaur and [[Four Arms (Classic)|Four Arms]] from appearing too frequently.{{Refn|[[:File:Dwayne and Glen Suggested Other Aliens.png]]|group = DM}}
*Humungousaur never used his size alteration powers in '''Omniverse''' because no one from the crew ever brought it up.{{Refn|[[:File:Humungousaur Size Altercation Absent in OV.png]]|group = DJW}}
*Humungousaur was originally not in ''[[Inside Man]]''{{Refn|[https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/ben10/images/2/24/Inside_Man_Script_Outline.pdf/revision/latest ''A Man Inside'' Script Outline]|group = outline}} or ''[[Catch a Falling Star]]'', with [[Ultimate Humungousaur]] taking his role in the latter.{{Refn|https://preservetube.com/watch?v&#61;2nlTm8GKnt8|group = am}}
*In an ADR script for ''[[Vengeance of Vilgax: Part 2]]'' dated June 22, 2009, Humungousaur demonstrated the ability to shrink down to smaller than blades of grass.{{Refn|group = script|name = adr}}
*Humungousaur was originally supposed to appear in:
**''[[Escape From Aggregor]]''.{{Refn|[https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/ben10/images/6/60/EFA_Script_Outline.pdf ''Escape From Aggregor'' Script Outline]|group = outline}} His role was taken by Four Arms in the final version of the episode.
**''[[Viktor: The Spoils]]'', to battle [[Dr. Viktor|King Viktor]].{{Refn|[https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/ben10/images/f/f6/VTS_Script_First_Draft_V1_with_Dwayne%27s_Edits.pdf ''Viktor: The Spoils'' Script First Draft with Dwayne McDuffie's Edits (First Version)]|group = script|name = first1}}
**''[[The Purge]]''.{{Refn|[https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/ben10/images/7/71/The_Purge_Script_Outline.pdf ''The Purge'' Script Outline]|group = outline}} His role was taken by [[NRG]], [[Spidermonkey (Classic)|Spidermonkey]] and [[Ultimate Spidermonkey]] in the final version of the episode.
**''[[The Mother of All Vreedles]]'', to take the [[Rustbucket 3]] out of the water and put it in land.{{Refn|[https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/ben10/images/a/ae/The_Mother_of_All_Vreedles_DRAFT-1_August_5_2010.pdf ''The Mother of All Vreedles'' Script First Draft]|group = script}}{{Refn|[https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/ben10/images/8/8f/The_Mother_of_All_Vreedles_DRAFT-1_August_26_2010.pdf ''The Mother of All Vreedles'' Script First Draft (Second Version)]|group = script}}{{Refn|[https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/ben10/images/b/b0/The_Mother_of_All_Vreedles_DRAFT-2.pdf ''The Mother of All Vreedles'' Script Second Draft]|group = script|name = second}}
**The dream in ''[[Night of the Living Nightmare]]'', used by Ben and Albedo.{{Refn|[https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/ben10/images/d/d4/Night_of_the_Living_Nightmare_Script_First_Draft.pdf ''Night of the Living Nightmare'' Script First Draft]|group = script|name = first}}
*Humungousaur was originally supposed to appear a second time in:
**''[[Busy Box]]'' to defeat the [[Naljian Destructor]] as Amalgamation Robot.{{Refn|[https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/ben10/images/2/2e/Busy_Box_Script_Outline.pdf ''Busy Box'' Script Outline]|group = outline}}{{Refn|[https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/ben10/images/9/9f/Busy_Box_Script_First_Draft.pdf ''Busy Box'' Script First Draft]|group = script}}
**''[[It's Not Easy Being Gwen]]'' to defeat [[Dr. Animo (Classic)|Animo]], specifically in the storyboards.{{Refn|https://archive.is/YKoW6|group = JHK}} His role was taken by [[Ultimate Cannonbolt]] in the script outline and the final version of the episode.
*The  [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bandolier bandolier] Humungousaur wears in '''Omniverse''' is similar to that of [[w:c:teentitans:Monsieur Mallah|Monsieur Mallah]]'s from '''[[Wikipedia:Teen Titans (TV series)|Teen Titans]]'''.
*While [[Dee Bradley Baker]] likes Humungousaur,{{Refn|https://preservetube.com/watch?v&#61;OiWjLqnA8es|group = DBB}} he does not like doing the alien's voice because it is hard on his throat.{{Refn|https://preservetube.com/watch?v&#61;C4AHkVCfju0|group = DBB}}{{Refn|https://preservetube.com/watch?v&#61;lM1IalUvH3U|group = DBB}}{{Refn|[[:File:Humungousaur Hard on Dee's Throat DJW Proof.png]]|group = DJW}}{{Refn|[[:File:Humungousaur Hard on Dee's Throat DJW Proof 2.png]]|group = DJW}} This vocal strain is part of the reason John DiMaggio took over in '''Omniverse'''.
*Humungousaur is [[Ryan Kelley]]'s favorite alien.{{Refn|https://youtu.be/q4uOx1MR7i0|group = RK}}
*Derrick preferred Humungousaur to Ultimate Humungousaur, including their '''Omniverse''' designs. This is because he was more of a Brachiosaur fan, as nothing could top them in his eyes.{{Refn|[[:File:Derrick's Opinion on the Ultimates' Designs.png]]|group = DJW}}

